## 📦 Installation

```bash
npm install @WolfgangM81/PROJECT_NAME
```

## 🚀 Development

```bash
# Install dependencies
npm install

# Build
npm run build

# Run tests
npm test

# Development mode
npm run dev
```

## 📝 Configuration

### Using with Verdaccio (Local Development)

```bash
# Point to local registry
npm config set registry http://localhost:4873/

# Install from local
npm install @WolfgangM81/PROJECT_NAME
```

### Using with GitHub Packages (Production)

```bash
# Authenticate
echo "//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${GITHUB_TOKEN}" >> ~/.npmrc

# Install from GitHub
npm install @WolfgangM81/PROJECT_NAME
```

